e four\\nsigned/unsigned division and remainder expressions in alu.sv are the\\nstrongest candidate for this deep arithmetic path. CoreMark fitness\\nscales directly with Fmax when instruction latency and cycle count stay\\nconstant. There are no earlier bench hypotheses or recorded lessons.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace only the real DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU datapath with one shared, fully\\ncombinational unsigned radix-4 restoring divider. Convert operands to\\nunsigned magn\n…[107046 of 110118 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:b4da770488bd02a8]…\nsigned extrema and equal operands. Exercise held WB refresh,\\nyounger EX/MEM priority, load/data stalls, M holds, misaligned\\ntargets, wrong-path effects and reset. Compare recovery,\\ntraining outcomes and RVFI PCs against the original scalar\\noperand-comparison reference cycle by cycle.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 165.29, \"delta_pct\": -5.36, \"vs_baseline\": 1263.78, \"fmax_mhz\": 72.366, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4378154, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6763, \"ff\": 2174, \"seeds\": [70.5, 72.366, 72.366], \"perturbations\": [[0, 70.5, 18], [1, 72.366, 18], [2, 72.366, 18]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_m/u_div/quotient_q_29_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_m/u_div/remainder_q_6_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -9.184, \"arrival_ns\": 19.479, \"logic_cells\": 71, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_m/u_div\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 18, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T06:38:30.016136Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 9}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
