{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_5", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfor line in Path('cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl').read_text().splitlines():\n r=json.loads(line)\n if r['id'] in ['hyp-20261001-001-r8s0','hyp-20261001-003-r8s2','hyp-20261001-003-r9s2','hyp-20261001-001-r9s0']:\n  h=r.get('hypothesis',{})\n  print(json.dumps({k:r.get(k) for k in ['id','title','outcome','fitness','fmax_mhz','critical_path','implementation_notes']},indent=2))\n  print(h.get('hypothesis') if isinstance(h,dict) else h)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "{\n  \"id\": \"hyp-20261001-001-r8s0\",\n  \"title\": \"Shared branch relation comparator with late condition inversion\",\n  \"outcome\": \"regression\",\n  \"fitness\": 170.41,\n  \"fmax_mhz\": 74.606,\n  \"critical_path\": {\n    \"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_m/u_div/quotient_q_31_s1\",\n    \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_m/u_div/remainder_q_1_s1\",\n    \"slack_ns\": -8.982,\n    \"arrival_ns\": 19.276,\n    \"logic_cells\": 70,\n    \"modules\": [\n      \"clock_ibuf\",\n      \"cpu/u_ex/u_m/u_div\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"implementation_notes\": \"\"\n}\nReplace only the six-arm branch comparator in ex_stage.sv with one\nshared unsigned comparison and equality reduction, sign correction,\nrelation selection and final inversion. Add four scalar logic signals\nbranch_equal, branch_unsigned_lt, branch_signed_lt and branch_relation\nnext to branch_cond. Inside the existing branch always_comb, replace\nthe comparator case with exactly these assignments:\n\n  branch_equal = ~|(rs1 ^ rs2);\n  branch_unsigned_lt = rs1 < rs2;\n  branch_signed_lt = (rs1[31] ^ rs2[31]) ? rs1[31] : branch_unsigned_lt;\n  branch_relation = in.ctrl.branch_op[2]\n                    ? (in.ctrl.branch_op[1] ? branch_unsigned_lt : branch_signed_lt)\n                    : branch_equal;\n  branch_cond = (in.ctrl.branch_op[2] || !in.ctrl.branch_op[1])\n                && (branch_relation ^ in.ctrl.branch_op[0]);\n\nBoth rs operands already have unsigned logic [31:0] types. Signed\nless-than equals unsigned less-than when their signs agree; when\nsigns differ it equals rs1[31]. The selected relation is equality for\nBEQ/BNE, signed less-than for BLT/BGE and unsigned less-than for\nBLTU/BGEU. The final XOR yields NE/GE/GEU. The outer qualification\nexplicitly returns false for reserved operations 2 and 3, matching\nthe old default. Preserve decoder default-illegal discipline.\n\nThis is one local branch datapath micro-optimization at the existing\nexecute edge. Preserve all expressions following the replaced case,\nincluding branch_taken, branch/jump targets, alignment faults, actual\ntransfer, redirect and training qualifications, producer eligibility\na\n…[16706 of 19778 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:093222d8e5e95c12]…\nclock progress bounds, formal/cosim gates,\ncanonical CRC/UART/bounds/markers and exactly 4378154 CoreMark cycles.\n\nAn isolated compact three-plane prototype using COMBINATIONAL plane\nmasks measured 72.427/77.878/77.878 MHz across Gowin options 0/1/2:\nmedian 77.878 MHz, 6599 logic cells and 2170 registers. That is only a\n1.85 percent frequency gain and does not pass acceptance. This proposal\nspecifically adds the decode-registered one-hot mask to remove its\nremaining encoded-selector decode and plane-arbitration control cone.\nThat final refinement has not been timed; confidence is low. A broader\nnine-source-pair prototype passed all 31 current pipeline tests but\nregressed timing, supporting the compact scope rather than replication\nacross every source pair. Require fresh correctness gates and all three\nvendor placements for the final implementation. At unchanged cycles,\nacceptance needs median Fmax above 79.983436 MHz and fitness above\n182.6839 iterations/second; ALU or divider recurrence can still limit it.\n\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
