nt champion scores 105.38 at 47.33 MHz with 4491485\\nstalled CoreMark marker cycles. LESSONS.md and the structural history\\nshow that registered division has removed the original arithmetic\\nbottleneck. The newest worst Gowin path instead crosses u_id, u_ex,\\nu_if, u_hazard and returns to u_\n10:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261001-003-r3s2\", \"title\": \"Compact bimodal prediction with validity-only recovery\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"The five-step registered-divider champion reaches 47.33 MHz and 105.38\\niterations/second, but still s\n…[21963 of 25035 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:aec231529092a5e7]…\nandom(0xDADA)\n    istalls, dstalls = stalls if isinstance(stalls, tuple) else (stalls, stalls)\n    counters = [1] * 64\n    pending = None\n    long_remaining = 0\n    long_started = set()\n    long_addresses = set(long_stall or ())\n    fetch_remaining = dict(fetch_stalls or {})\n\n    for cycle in range(max_cycles):\n        dut.clock.value = 0\n        await Timer(1, \"ns\")\n        ia        = int(dut.io_imemAddr.value)\n        da        = int(dut.io_dmemAddr.value)\n        wen       = int(dut.io_dmemWEn.value)\n        request = (da, int(dut.io_dmemWData.value), wen, int(dut.io_dmemREn.value))\n        mem_payload = int(dut.ex_mem_w.value)\n        req_addr, req_data, req_wmask, req_rmask, req_fault = _ex_request(mem_payload)\n        assert request == (req_addr, req_data, req_wmask, int(bool(req_rmask)))\n        if not mem_payload & 1 or req_fault:\n            assert not req_wmask and not req_rmask\n        if int(dut.u_ex.m_busy.value):\n            assert _ex_request(int(dut.u_ex.m_metadata_q.value))[2:] == (0, 0, 0)\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
