{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_6", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"rg -n '\\\"category\\\":\\\\s*\\\"micro_opt\\\"|hyp-20261001-002-r12s1|hyp-20261001-001-r6s0|hyp-20261001-001-r8s0' cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\"", "aggregated_output": "1:{\"id\": \"baseline-bench-4a6c0e6\", \"title\": \"Baseline retest for cores/bench\", \"category\": \"micro_opt\", \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 12.12, \"delta_pct\": 0.0, \"vs_baseline\": 0.0, \"fmax_mhz\": 5.442, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 12312, \"ff\": 460, \"seeds\": [5.14, 5.442, 5.442], \"perturbations\": [[0, 5.14, 150], [1, 5.442, 149], [2, 5.442, 149]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_3_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -189.542, \"arrival_ns\": 199.837, \"logic_cells\": 156, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 150, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T01:19:05.524526Z\", \"round_id\": 0, \"slot\": 0}\n2:{\"id\": \"hyp-20261001-001-r1s0\", \"title\": \"Shared radix-4 combinational divider with borrow-based digit selection\", \"category\": \"micro_opt\", \"motivation\": \"The baseline reaches only 5.442 MHz, with a 199.837 ns, 156-cell worst\\npath crossing operand forwarding and the combinational ALU. The four\\nsigned/unsigned division and remainder expressions in alu.sv are the\\nstrongest candidate for this deep arithmetic path. CoreMark fitness\\nscales directly with Fmax when instruction latency and cycle count stay\\nconstant. There are no earlier bench hypotheses or recorded lessons.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The baseline reaches only 5.442 MHz, with a 199.837 ns, 156-cell worst\\npath crossing operand forwarding and the combinational ALU. The four\\nsigned/unsigned division and remainder expressions in alu.sv are the\\nstrongest candidate for this deep arithmetic path. CoreMark fitness\\nscales directly with Fmax when instruction latency and cycle count stay\\nconstant. There are no earlier bench hypotheses or recorded lessons.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace only the real DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU datapath with one shared, fully\\ncombinational unsigned radix-4 restoring divider. Convert operands to\\nunsigned magn\n…[108154 of 111226 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:5eb61b6f7c19c278]…\n/M streams.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 193.44, \"delta_pct\": 5.86, \"vs_baseline\": 1496.04, \"fmax_mhz\": 79.218, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4095164, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6816, \"ff\": 2345, \"seeds\": [79.211, 79.218, 79.218], \"perturbations\": [[0, 79.211, 16], [1, 79.218, 16], [2, 79.218, 16]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"lfsr_5_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/cursor_q_13_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -7.625, \"arrival_ns\": 17.919, \"logic_cells\": 36, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 16, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T09:23:54.471662Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 12, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20261001-002-r12s1 (improvement, +5.86%): Two fixed circular fetch slots hide CoreMark instruction-bus stalls profitably when preserved recovery_pending_q discards stale entries and one-edge BHT training registers keep late EX feedback out of wide slot writes and cursor/occupancy updates.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
