is-phase\n.gitignore:30:# sandbox check in tools/agents/hypothesis.py rolls back the next slot's\n.gitignore:33:# every rep was hypothesis_gen_failed for this reason.\n.gitignore:37:# and per-hypothesis by tools/agents/hypothesis.py for `tail -f` visibility\n.gitignore:74:#   iteration (accept/regression/broken). Rejected hypotheses never\n.gitignore:80:# - per-iteration worktrees and per-iteration hypothesis YAMLs are\n.gitignore:88:cores/*/experiments/hypotheses/\n.gitignore:89:cores/*/experiments/hypotheses/*.yml\n.gitignore:90:cores/*/experiments/hypotheses/*.yaml\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
