matrix and state kernels\\nemphasize pointer operations, multiplication and CRC/bit operations;\\nsource-level divisions occur mainly in initialization and reporting.\\nThis makes extra DIV/REM latency a promising trade for higher Fmax.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Keep the existing single-issue pipeline and combinationa\n…[136813 of 139885 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:223f3cc8fe5309b0]…\nreal and ALTOPS modes, including a pending corrected fetch blocked by imem. Preserve the existing ten-clock ready-bus progress assertions, arithmetic references and ordered exact-once side-effect checks; confirm that immediate squash prevents wrong-path M launch.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 183.15, \"delta_pct\": 0.23, \"vs_baseline\": 1411.14, \"fmax_mhz\": 80.188, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4378154, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6708, \"ff\": 2211, \"seeds\": [78.412, 80.188, 80.188], \"perturbations\": [[0, 78.412, 15], [1, 80.188, 15], [2, 80.188, 15]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.read_data_4_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.alu_result_28_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -7.753, \"arrival_ns\": 18.047, \"logic_cells\": 36, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_rf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 15, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T08:36:18.325295Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 11}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
