{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport yaml\np = Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261001-002-r2s1.yaml')\nh = yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\nh['title'] = 'Repartition division into seven five-bit registered iterations'\ns = h['hypothesis']\ns = s.replace('eight four-bit', 'seven five-bit').replace('four existing', 'five existing').replace('eight\\\\n  four-bit', 'seven\\\\n  five-bit')\ns = s.replace('After eight', 'After seven').replace('a ninth loop', 'an eighth loop')\ns = s.replace('eight LOOP edges', 'seven LOOP edges').replace('the retirement spacing is at most ten clocks', 'adjacent division retirement spacing is nine clocks')\ns = s.replace('eight-iteration', 'seven-iteration').replace('first division after\\\\n      an ordinary producer', 'first division after\\\\n      an ordinary producer or taken control transfer')\ns = s.replace('Initialize remainder and the three-bit loop counter.', 'Zero-extend the magnitude dividend into a 35-bit quotient shift\\\\n  register with three leading zeros, initialize remainder and the\\\\n  three-bit loop counter. Seven uniform five-bit groups then consume\\\\n  all 35 bits; the extra leading zero steps leave quotient/remainder\\\\n  unchanged for every nonzero divisor. Select the final quotient from\\\\n  the low 32 bits, with divisor-zero handled by the existing override.')\ns = s.replace('an ordinary instruction immediately before division.', 'an ordinary instruction immediately before division. A taken branch\\\\n  or jump immediately followed by division consumes one additional\\\\n  frontend recovery clock, so the seven-iteration schedule leaves\\\\n  room for that case within the same ten-clock bound.')\nh['hypothesis'] = s\nh['changes'][0]['description'] = '''Repartition the divider into launch-time registered magnitude\npreparation, seven uniform iterations of five restoring bits, and\nDONE result correction consumed on acceptance. Use a 35-bit quotient\nshift register initialized with the 32-bit magnitude dividend plus\nthree leading zero bits. Remove the dedicated PREP/CORRECT cycles,\nwiden the iteration counter, preserve exact RV32M exceptional cases,\nfreeze all result sources in DONE, and match the real handshake timing\nand exact formulas under ALTOPS.\n'''\nh['changes'][1]['description'] = h['changes'][1]['description'].replace('eight clocks', 'seven clocks')\nh['changes'][2]['description'] = h['changes'][2]['description'].replace('eight-iteration', 'seven-iteration').replace('an ordinary producer', 'an ordinary producer or taken branch/JAL/JALR')\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(h, sort_keys=False, width=76, default_flow_style=False))\nprint('Hypothesis refined to reserve a recovery clock after taken transfers.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
