verride. Initialize the\n32-bit quotient shifter to {magnitude_a[29:0], seed_quotient[1:0]}\nand remainder to the zero-extended seed remainder. Capture original\ndividend and exact quotient/remainder sign and exception metadata.\n\nEach of six LOOP edges consumes five of the remaining 30 numerator\nbits. For the radix-8 digit form T={remainder,next_three_bits} as an\nunsigned 35-bit number. Evaluate T-kD for k=1..7 concurrently with\na 36th borrow bit. Select the largest fitting digit 0..7 and its\nmatching residual using monotonic-fit-derived mutually exclusive\nterms and a\n…[11375 of 14447 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:7b58b85d0897c776]…\npercent threshold.\nArea was 6537 logic cells and 2101 registers versus 6561 and 2101;\nLUT-RAM/BSRAM/DSP remained 0/4/2. The option-0 worst path moved from\nWB-to-fetch at 20.298 ns to the divider at 19.276 ns. This timing\nevidence supports the exact full-width unsigned-comparison topology.\nKeep that topology rather than substituting a low-31-bit comparator\nwith sign-first selection: its separately measured median was only\n72.415 MHz, a 2.86 percent gain below the acceptance threshold.\n\nExpected gain is 6 percent. These are prototype measurements, not\nevaluator acceptance. The threshold requires median Fmax above\n73.642584 MHz and fitness above 168.20726 at unchanged cycles.\nRetain every gate, run the unchanged complete formal suite and fresh\nstalled cosim/CoreMark validation, and score all three Gowin placements.\nThe main limits are the narrow margin above threshold, synthesis or\nplacement differences, and divider/operand-routing paths becoming\ncritical. Do not broaden this hypothesis to another timing cone.\n\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
