g every process sharing this\n# riscv-formal checkout (the K concurrent agents of a run share it through\n# their worktrees' symlink). The name used to be \"$CORE_NAME-$$\", but an\n# agent's sandboxed shell runs in its own PID namespace where $$ is 2 or 3\n# for every agent, so siblings wrote into one dir and wiped each other's\n# checks mid-SBY (V2 incident 03). mktemp gives a unique name instead.\n# FORMAL_WORK_ID pins the suffix so tools/eval/formal.py can remove exactly\n# its own dir afterwards. genchecks.py derives @core\n…[11799 of 14871 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:1ff87d23bc4d4c72]…\nay lead to the excessive delay or skew\n[90%] Routing Phase 3 completed\nRunning timing analysis......\n[95%] Timing analysis completed\nPlacement and routing completed\nBitstream generation in progress......\nBitstream generation completed\nRunning power analysis......\n[100%] Power analysis completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/bf842e9a/9dfe551b/fetch_queue_probe/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.power.html\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/bf842e9a/9dfe551b/fetch_queue_probe/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.pin.html\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/bf842e9a/9dfe551b/fetch_queue_probe/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.rpt.html\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/bf842e9a/9dfe551b/fetch_queue_probe/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.rpt.txt\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/bf842e9a/9dfe551b/fetch_queue_probe/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.tr.html\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/bf842e9a/9dfe551b/fetch_queue_probe/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.tr\" completed\nThu Oct  1 08:13:07 2026\n\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
