slot writes remain unchanged.\n  Pending correction without acceptance remains physical-only. Corrected\n  acceptance selects a slot only when the token is buffered rather than\n  consumed by empty fall-through on the same edge. Preserve these actual\n  register boundaries with the\n…[2636 of 5708 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:50768880231d4d72]…\nstage.sv\n    description: |\n      Add preserved one-hot head_select_q with shared next-occupancy and\n      next-head calculations. Use registered source masks for raw head\n      selection and registered slot availability, preserving bookkeeping\n      and prediction. Assert exact correspondence to pending/count/head\n      state and one-hot selection; retain all existing formal assertions.\n  - file: test/test_fetch_queue.py\n    description: |\n      Extend the independent cycle model checks to cover registered live-head\n      presentation across every occupancy, push/pop combination, redirect,\n      pending recovery, bus/decode stall and reset. Retain all existing\n      raw-payload and token-conservation checks and require cycle equivalence.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Exercise corrected fetch bypass and buffering during load-use, data\n      stalls and M holds; preserve retirement PC/order, progress bounds,\n      immediate wrong-path squash and wrong-path store/M suppression checks.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
